    "psl_seed": 7
  },
  "notes": [
    "This phase intentionally executes only A0, A1, and bounded A2.",
    "The 32-edge cap is above the historical IID40 proposal count of 26, so it prevents future explosion without retrospectively truncating that smoke result.",
    "Direct model-visible evidence is preserved and does not consume the abductive budget.",
    "After D2 passes, expand seeds and incidents before starting A3-A5."
  ]
